        "url" : "https://damianflynn.github.io/posts/hitting-reset/",
        "summary": "10 Years, It is hard to believe that I have been posting thoughts here that long. And how so much has changed since I begun?\nI started this journey with the encouragement of some amazing people in Microsoft, as an opportunity to spread the news about Hyper-V and even more relevant at the time System Center Virtual Machine Manager which was still known by its code name!.\n",
        "author" : {
